        "Abstract": "Task-oriented dialog (TOD) has predominantly focused on English, primarily due to the shortage of robust TOD datasets in other languages. We introduce MULTI 2 WOZ, a new multilingual multi-domain TOD dataset derived from MultiWOZ, and a framework for multilingual conversational specialization of pretrained language models."
